From ecb629823d14401c3c8d1bc1128d9c43d7ba7a9b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 00:04:46 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 192/201] Installer: Japanese for the remaining messages;
 remove the cache with the preferences

The uninstaller's confirmation for deleting the user configuration and
the installer's folder warnings were in English in the Japanese
language file. Removing the preferences now also removes the cache in
the temporary folder of the user running the uninstaller, which was
left behind as an empty folder.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 package/WindowsInstaller/lang/japanese.nsh   | 14 +++++++-------
 package/WindowsInstaller/setup/uninstall.nsh |  2 ++
 2 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/package/WindowsInstaller/lang/japanese.nsh b/package/WindowsInstaller/lang/japanese.nsh
index 8f0531f6c..e375e992a 100644
--- a/package/WindowsInstaller/lang/japanese.nsh
+++ b/package/WindowsInstaller/lang/japanese.nsh
@@ -61,12 +61,12 @@ ${LangFileString} SecUnPreferencesDescription 'ユーザー共通のFreeCADの
 						$AppSuff\$\r$\n\
 						${APP_DIR_USERDATA}$\")$\r$\n\
 						を削除します。'
-${LangFileString} DialogUnPreferences 'You chose to delete the FreeCADs user configuration.$\r$\n\
-						This will also delete all installed FreeCAD addons.$\r$\n\
-						Do you agree with this?'
+${LangFileString} DialogUnPreferences 'FreeCADのユーザー設定を削除するよう選びました。$\r$\n\
+						インストールしたアドオンもすべて削除されます。$\r$\n\
+						削除してよろしいですか？'
 ${LangFileString} SecUnProgramFilesDescription "FreeCADとすべての附属コンポーネントの導入解除を行います。"
 
-${LangFileString} DirNotEmptyWarning "The selected folder '$INSTDIR' is not empty.$\r$\n\
-                        The installer will remove all its content before installing. Continue?"
-${LangFileString} RMInstDirFailed "Failed to remove '$INSTDIR'.$\r$\n\
-                        Make sure you have sufficient permissions and that no files are in use."
+${LangFileString} DirNotEmptyWarning "選んだフォルダ '$INSTDIR' は空ではありません。$\r$\n\
+                        インストールの前に、中身をすべて削除します。続けますか？"
+${LangFileString} RMInstDirFailed "'$INSTDIR' を削除できませんでした。$\r$\n\
+                        権限があるか、使用中のファイルがないかを確かめてください。"
diff --git a/package/WindowsInstaller/setup/uninstall.nsh b/package/WindowsInstaller/setup/uninstall.nsh
index b9dbffa61..6ac959b65 100644
--- a/package/WindowsInstaller/setup/uninstall.nsh
+++ b/package/WindowsInstaller/setup/uninstall.nsh
@@ -90,6 +90,8 @@ Section /o "un.$(UnFreeCADPreferencesTitle)" un.SecUnPreferences
  Call un.DelAppPathSub # function from Utils.nsh
  # remove the registry key that stores the main window parameters
  DeleteRegKey HKCU "SOFTWARE\${APP_NAME}"
+ # and the cache in the temporary folder of the user running the uninstaller
+ RMDir /r "$TEMP\${APP_DIR_USERDATA}"
  NotPreferences:
 
 SectionEnd
-- 
2.43.0

